{% comment %}
  TapGreetings Happy Holidays Series 1: Master Collection & Box Set Product Page
  - Centered unexpanded media viewport (max-width 420px, 9:16 aspect ratio) matching Pink-O-Ween
  - 4-Slide Multimedia Showcase: Card Video, Front Art, Back Art, and Mobile NFC Tap Demo (Ghost Tap)
  - Interactive Variant Selection Thumbnail Reel (Box Set + 16 Cards)
  - Dynamic Video & Image Switching upon Variant Selection
  - Dual Add-to-Cart Forms (Below Media & In Purchase Panel)
  - Full Dark Mode & Light Mode High-Contrast Support
{% endcomment %}

